        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Cabo&rsquo;s waters are typically calm. Sailboats heel (tilt) gently under sail &mdash; most guests find it exciting, not unsettling. If anyone in your group is uncomfortable, we reef the sails or motor for a flatter ride.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-s-help" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-s-help">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Can we help sail?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Yes! Our crew welcomes guests who want to handle a line, trim the sails, or take the helm under supervision. It&rsquo;s one of the favorite parts for guests who already sail &mdash; and a great intro for anyone curious.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-s-snorkel" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-s-snorkel">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Can we snorkel from the sailboat?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Yes. <strong>Pelican Rock</strong> is the standard snorkel stop on every sailing trip &mdash; calm, clear water, tropical fish, sea lions. Snorkel gear in all sizes is included. Beginners and kids welcome; the crew helps anyone who needs it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-s-sunset" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-s-sunset">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Is sailing good for sunset?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">Yes &mdash; it&rsquo;s our most popular private sailing booking. Golden hour, sails up, no engine. Book a dedicated <a href="/tours/shared-sunset/" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">shared sunset sail</a>, a <a href="/tours/private-sunset/" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">private sunset charter</a>, or add a sunset return to a private day charter.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-s-weather" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-s-weather">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">What happens if the weather is bad?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">If the captain determines it&rsquo;s unsafe to sail, we reschedule your trip at no charge &mdash; or refund in full if you can&rsquo;t rebook. Cabo&rsquo;s weather is excellent year-round, but in the rare case of high winds or rough seas we always prioritize safety. See our <a href="/policies/" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">cancellation &amp; weather policies</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item border border-border-light rounded-2xl overflow-hidden bg-white">
      <input class="hidden" id="faq-s-where" type="checkbox"/>
      <label class="flex items-center justify-between p-4 cursor-pointer" for="faq-s-where">
        <span class="text-base font-semibold text-navy">Where do we meet?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-slate-500 faq-chevron transition-transform duration-300">expand_more</span>
      </label>
      <div class="faq-answer max-h-0 overflow-hidden opacity-0 transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out px-4 pb-4">
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">All sailings depart from Cabo Marina, Dock F. We&rsquo;ll send detailed directions and a map after booking. <a href="/shuttle-service/" class="text-accent-gold font-semibold hover:underline">Shuttle service</a> available from any Cabo hotel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
